  "Restore…": "Wiederherstellen…",
  "Restoring changes which servers Rivulet searches — a backup carries its own source list, and it wins.": "Wiederherstellen ändert, welche Server Rivulet fragt — ein Backup bringt seine eigene Quellenliste mit, und die gewinnt.",
  "Restrict content by age rating. A PIN prevents changes without authorization.": "TODO_TRANSLATION: Restrict content by age rating. A PIN prevents changes without authorization.",
  "Results for “{query}”": "Ergebnisse für „{query}“",
  "Resume": "Fortsetzen",
